---
statement: To find the center of a given circle. </font color> <p><b><a href="propIII1.html#cor">Corollary.</a></b> If in a circle a straight line cuts a straight line into two equal parts and at right angles, then the center of the circle lies on the cutting straight line.
---
red_highlight: yes
